{"evt":"note_created","id":"note-mqiu0dxkclu","workspace":"D:\\zonoid","title":"Learned ask/edge classifiers run in SHADOW; live source flips heuristic->learned only via a one-way promotion","summary":"The hand-tuned heuristic is the live decider by default. A separately-trained logistic classifier (scripts/ask-clf-*) runs ALONGSIDE in shadow, writing shadow_decision/shadow_conf to .graph/ask-journal.jsonl as training signal WITHOUT deciding. lib/ask-promote.js runs a comparator each cycle and only flips .graph/ask-clf/mode.json from 'heuristic' to 'learned' (one-way, shadow->enforce) once the model beats the heuristic by a margin over a stable window. A missing model/mode file degrades to pure heuristic, so the gate stays usable offline. Same pattern mirrors edge-clf/mode.json.","created_by":null,"valid_from":"2026-06-18T01:39:08.552Z","vec":[-0.09559006243944168,-0.057859867811203,-0.05688298121094704,0.06797685474157333,0.08163189142942429,-0.10461894422769547,-0.035740893334150314,-0.0382218174636364,-0.04674912244081497,0.036279890686273575,0.030730288475751877,0.03490380197763443,-0.042618151754140854,-0.01008214708417654,0.07040068507194519,0.05245010182261467,-0.0005080333212390542,-0.032641854137182236,-0.053746502846479416,-0.021593134850263596,0.011551899835467339,-0.07394823431968689,0.0265241339802742,-0.03742971271276474,-0.034962207078933716,-0.05458255484700203,-0.035422079265117645,-0.0006085138884373009,0.05613164231181145,-0.0821879506111145,0.06040818616747856,0.06120091304183006,-0.01809539459645748,-0.020742934197187424,-0.019969291985034943,0.023575512692332268,-0.014477650634944439,-0.06858500838279724,0.028739409521222115,0.02434459701180458,-0.02041243389248848,-0.016138389706611633,-0.04157930985093117,-0.020060181617736816,0.032488465309143066,-0.044542282819747925,-0.03867272287607193,-0.022218262776732445,-0.02795521356165409,-0.016010798513889313,-0.02976112999022007,-0.10281533002853394,0.028921548277139664,-0.029640858992934227,-0.02